const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究国家法律制度与证券监管是否关联跨国权益资本成本差异。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"The article studies whether country legal institutions and securities regulation relate to international differences in the cost of equity capital. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2006.00209.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它以法律和监管分类及隐含权益成本度量比较公司和国家，国家编码和估计模型均属于设计。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It compares firms and countries using legal and regulatory classifications alongside implied cost-of-equity measures, making country coding and estimation model part of the design. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2006.00209.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"输入包括历史国家分类、法律和监管变量、公司财务、时点市场数据、预测或估值输入及国家年份覆盖。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"Inputs include historical country classifications, legal and regulatory variables, firm financials, point-in-time market data, forecast or valuation inputs, and country-year coverage. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2006.00209.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"研究讨论跨国经验差异，不给当前法律制度评级、不确定单一公司合规状态，也不证明单一制度原因。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The study concerns cross-country empirical differences; it does not rate current legal systems, determine a single firm's compliance status, or prove one institutional cause. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2006.00209.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"冻结法律编码版本和国家样本；区分成文法与执法；复现隐含成本模型并处理货币、上市和缺失市场。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Freeze legal-code versions and country sample; separate law on the books from enforcement; reproduce the implied-cost model and account for currency, listings, and missing markets. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2006.00209.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Accounting Research (2006)。历史国家比较并非法律意见、实时监管评估或当前公司层面的资本成本报价。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Accounting Research (2006). Historical country comparisons are not legal advice, a live regulatory assessment, or a current company-level cost-of-capital quotation. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2006.00209.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (2006) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“International Differences in the Cost of Equity Capital: Do Legal Institutions and Securities Regulation Matter?”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。历史国家比较并非法律意见、实时监管评估或当前公司层面的资本成本报价。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “International Differences in the Cost of Equity Capital: Do Legal Institutions and Securities Regulation Matter?”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
